Rule 1 (feature tensor must be one of the allowed types)
{v_1 : tensor} |= v_1 = 1 ∨ v_1 = 2 ∨ v_1 = 3 ∨ v_1 = 4
>>
Rule 4 (input tensor should be valid for Softplus operation)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (feature tensor should not have negative values)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 7 (feature tensor should have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 9 (feature tensor should have non-zero values)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) > 0
